    4330	useful), C-accelerated Lucy gives `K* ~ sqrt(width)` (mid-regime),
    4331	HKM projection gives `K* ~ const` (Aggarwal-pure dominates). The
    4332	asymptotic O(sqrt(n) log^4 n) bound is preserved; the composition is
    4333	a **practical-constant tightening only**. See
